---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site, services } from '../config/site';
---
<BaseLayout {...site.seo.services}>
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container page-hero-inner"><div><p class="eyebrow light"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span>OUR SERVICES</p><h1>从问题出发，<br /><em>走向可能。</em></h1></div><p>我们把策略、设计和技术连接起来，为企业构建实用且能持续演进的数字能力。</p></div><span class="page-hero-index">01 / SERVICES</span></section>
  <section class="section service-detail-section"><div class="container"><div class="section-intro"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span>CAPABILITIES</p><p>围绕你的目标，选择真正需要的能力。以下服务描述均为示例，可直接在配置文件中修改。</p></div><div class="service-detail-list">{services.map((service) => <article class="service-detail"><div class="detail-number">{service.number} <span>/ {String(services.length).padStart(2, '0')}</span></div><div><span class="card-overline">{service.category}</span><h2>{service.title}</h2><p>{service.details}</p></div><div class="deliverables"><span>可交付内容示例</span>{service.deliverables.map((item) => <div>{item}<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div>)}</div></article>)}</div></div></section>
  <section class="section process-section"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span>HOW WE WORK</p><h2>清晰的过程，<br /><em>更好的结果。</em></h2></div><p>每个项目都不同，但我们始终坚持从理解、规划到交付的完整路径。</p></div><div class="process-grid">{site.process.map((step) => <div class="process-card"><span>{step.number}</span><h3>{step.title}</h3><p>{step.description}</p></div>)}</div></div></section>
  <section class="mini-cta"><div class="container"><h2>让我们聊聊你的下一个项目。</h2><a class="button button-accent" href="/contact/">开始交流 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
